## 3. INTEGRATED BILL OF MATERIALS ADDITIONS (v1.2)

| ID    | Component                          | Function                                      | Notes |
|-------|------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------|-------|
| IV-18 | Shaped magnetic nozzle assembly    | Focuses and directs the abrasive stream       | Wearable + fixed variants |
| IV-19 | Velocity / focus control manifold  | Tunes particle speed and stream geometry      | Haptic or automated |
| IV-20 | Magnetic cyclone byproduct separator | Recovers spent iron oxide for reuse         | Closed abundance loop |
| IV-21 | Pressurized gas micro-cylinder     | Secondary fluidization and velocity boost     | CO₂ or air |

All previous dual-state components (IV-01 through IV-17) remain in force.

